  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed outbuilding by inclusion of a bathroom would not be incidental to main dwellinghouse, and as certified on site is to be used as a self-contained accommodation by current or future occupants, causing a serious and adverse effect on the amenities enjoyed by residents of that area contrary to Local Plan Policy, SC7 and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines (2024) and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - 2.\tThe proposed extension to the existing outbuilding would by reason of its height, design and loss of original eaves be out of scale and character with this and surrounding dwellings, as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality and the character and appearance of the Gunnersbury Park conservation area. Thus, it is contrary to Local Plan Policies SC7, CC1, CC2 and CC4 of Local Plan, policies of London Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework."
